{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07541","headline":"咏史十一首 三 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巢许在嵩颍，陶唐不得臣。\n九州尚洗耳，一命安能亲。\n緜邈数千祀，丘中谁隐沦。\n朝游公卿府，夕是山林人。\n蒲帛扬侧陋，薜萝爲缙绅。\n九重念入梦，三事思降神。\n且设庭中燎，宁窥泉下鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}